# Lyna, Veil of Vengeance's ability targets Bot1's Cecil, Dark Knight; in response Ephemerate exiles Cecil and returns it, a
# new object (CR 400.7), so the target is gone and no shadow counter is put on anything (CR 608.2b): the new Cecil has
# deathtouch and no shadow.
# Turn 1: Swamp, the three Moxes pay Lyna, the Swamp Cecil. Turn 3: Plains; the Moxes pay {3}, the Plains Ephemerate.

